# Rough estimates of AI usage by the hledger project.
# See also ../AI.md, and `just ai-help` which describes the data sources.

# The units are generic kilo-output-tokens, mostly opus and fable (see commodities.journal).
include commodities.journal

# Payees are data sources. Currently these overlap a lot; select sources as needed.
payee ccusage  ; sm's claude code usage, extracted from not-yet-expired logs by ccusage
payee commits  ; usage logged in commit messages. Mine is included in ccusage
payee prs      ; usage logged in a pull request
payee extra    ; usage logged manually in this journal. Mine is included in ccusage

# Accounts are developers.
account sm
account acinader
account adamsardo
account kevinkonrad

